{"id":"n66643-1-10","stage":2,"title":"사라지다 · 消失","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66643-1-10-1","ko":"요즘에도 신입생이 들어오면 술을 먹여?","zh":"现在新来的学生也会被灌酒吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘에도","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에도","audio":"/audio/ea044a660c81d8e36fbb.mp3"}},{"text":"신입생이","meaning":"新生","explanation":"신입생：新生；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신입생","audio":"/audio/1244cec62f5f4d3acef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65345","senseId":"1","lemma":"신입생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신입생이","audio":"/audio/27712074e93eaaf28f63.mp3"}},{"text":"들어오면","meaning":"参加，加入","explanation":"들어오다：参加，加入；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어오면","audio":"/audio/b03afcd3275793f3d208.mp3"}},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술을","audio":"/audio/8bbc7232261087ddd88e.mp3"}},{"text":"먹여?","meaning":"行贿","explanation":"먹이다：行贿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹이다","audio":"/audio/046ac878d568614edecf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61953","senseId":"4","lemma":"먹이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹여","audio":"/audio/5bff1c15ad205f4ef717.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近